id = "earth"
display_name = "Clay Crust"
description = "A pillar of clay raised where you point — taller the longer you hold. It throws a fly off its top, and you higher than you can jump. Aimed at a bundle, the clay seals it in a crust instead: cooked in it, it comes out clay-baked."
